Subject: ASoC: wcd937x: sequence headphone amplifiers within the SoundWire stream

Adapt Jonathan Marek's WCD938x pop/click fix to WCD9370/WCD9375. Enable the
headphone PA only after its supply settle delay, while SoundWire is enabled,
and disable it before hw_free tears down that stream. Preserve the capture
path and guard repeated mute callbacks against duplicate IRQ enable/disable.

Reference: https://lkml.iu.edu/hypermail/linux/kernel/2511.3/00064.html
Original idea: Jonathan Marek <jonathan@marek.ca>
Adaptation for BananaOS Duo Lite; hardware listening validation pending.

